<title>JAPAN: Jomo Twisting corrects its EPS estimate.</title>
<headline>Jomo Twisting corrects its EPS estimate.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Jomo Twisting Thread Co Ltd on Monday corrected its group earnings per share (EPS) estimate for the year to next March to 0.60 yen, instead of the 5.00 yen it announced on June 24.</p>
<p>The Japanese silk and yarn manufacturer did not give any reason for the correction.</p>
